<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, marginBottom: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>01</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>项目概述</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 24 }}>一句话概括 · 目标用户 · 解决问题 · 核心功能</Text>

  <Box style={{ padding: '20px 28px', background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 14, marginBottom: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <FAIcon name='quote-left' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
        成果展示广场是「警院 WeChat 全生态」的成果展示平台，把实训作品集中呈现、让访客体验反馈、让优秀成果沉淀为教学资源。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 24, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 14 }}>
        <FAIcon name='users' style={{ fill: '#2563EB', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>目标用户</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        学员（创作者）<br />老师 / 助教（审核方）<br />管理员（运营方）<br />访客 / 校友（浏览方）
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 24, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 14 }}>
        <FAIcon name='exclamation-circle' style={{ fill: '#EA580C', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>解决的问题</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        成果无处展示、曝光不足<br />缺少体验反馈、难迭代<br />优秀作品无法沉淀传承<br />内容质量缺乏把关
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 24, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 14, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 14 }}>
        <FAIcon name='th-large' style={{ fill: '#0D9488', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>核心功能</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        投稿与两级审核<br />展示墙与搜索推荐<br />互动反馈与体验<br />验收认证与课例回流
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
